 "text": "9/29/26, 10:19 AM\n\nDisconnection document\n\nDisconnection actions\n6                                      2\n\nRelease                 5           ,\n\nDisconnection order                     :\n\nDisconnection entry                    3.49                In the\nReconnection order                        |                      disconnection\n\nReconnection order                                               document the\nCompletion                                                       1                     actions canbe\nreversed from\n\nthe last to the\n\nfirst (in this\norder)\n\nDisconnection Actions\n\nStructure\n\nFrom the disconnection document, you can display the reference object logged within the document, go to the data hierarchy of\nthe object or change it.\n\nIn the disconnection document all the created disconnection and reconnection orders, as well as entry transactions for\ndisconnection and reconnection are logged as disconnection actions. From the disconnection document you can access the\nservice orders and disconnection data.\n\nAll the devices contained in the disconnection document are logged in the document as disconnection objects. You can display the\nmaterial serial numbers of all the devices. The disconnection is based on the device. Flat-rate installations can also be\ndisconnected.\n",
